{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cggan18Xrs5352aYhLDpL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I computed the doublet energies from approximate second-order formulas, not a full Tanabe–Sugano diagonalisation. The Dq/B = 1.00 doublet values and the 2T2g value at Dq/B = 3.50 are rougher estimates than the other entries.\n\n**Setup.** C/B = 3003/722 = 4.16. Energies are measured above the 4A2g ground term.\n\n- **4T2g:** E/B = 10·Dq/B exactly.\n- **4T1g(F):** this is the lower root of the 4T1g(F)–4T1g(P) matrix [[6Dq, 6B], [6B, 15B − 6Dq]], referred to 4A2g.\n- **2Eg:** E/B ≈ 9 + 3C/B − 9/(Dq/B) = 21.48 − 9/(Dq/B).\n- **2T1g:** E/B ≈ 21.48 − 6.6/(Dq/B), which puts it slightly above 2Eg.\n- **2T2g:** the strong-field limit is 15B + 5C, about 35.8B. I estimated a second-order lowering of roughly 8/(Dq/B) at Dq/B = 3.50.\n\n**Dq/B = 1.00.** The second-order formulas fail at this field. Here I used the weak-field value of about 4B + 3C = 16.5B for 2G, with a small shift.\n\n- 4T2g: 10.0\n- 4T1g(F): 13.3\n- 2Eg: about 16.3\n\n**Dq/B = 2.20**\n\n- 2Eg: 17.4\n- 2T1g: 18.5\n- 4T2g: 22.0\n\n**Dq/B = 3.50**\n\n- 2Eg: 18.9\n- 2T1g: 19.6\n- 2T2g: about 33.5 (4T2g is at 35.0, just above it)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":809,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee9d18d5-ff77-47e8-9a08-c83e9aa315fe","uuid":"a0045008-2e43-472e-864c-8f96e245f674","timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:57:00.538Z","request_id":"req_011Cggamzog6t1EhxhZGqLwf"}
